# Build context of the images built from the repository root (docker-compose.yml): the Dagster UI only
# needs pyproject.toml, and the pipeline image (Dockerfile) needs requirements.txt and its make wrapper.
# The code is mounted at run time, and .venv, data and .env must never reach an image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.txt
!docker/pipeline-make.sh
